    "body": "> I think you should probably open a new issue for yourself to uniformize all byte sequences in the spec to use backticks.\n\nFiled #156.\n\n> Let this instance of the fetching algorithm be associated with image request.\n\nThis is weird, but not new.\n\n> Shouldn't this be using the response concept?\n\nFiled #158.\n\n> \"Let request be the EventSource object's request\"\n\nDone and cleaned up the other steps. This is very common throughout the HTML Standard though. We really need IDL to standardize `this` and the `this@slot` syntax to make headway here.\n\n> I think the clarity here could be greatly improved, although I admit I am asking for changes to problems that were already there.\n\nWe can fix this as part of #158 or a separate issue.\n\n@zcorpan the referrer processing moved to https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/.\n",
